  "description": "The painter Joseph, who has excellent modeling skills but is not recognized for his lack of creative talent, tries to make an extreme choice, unable to overcome his sense of shame.\n\nThe secret woman who stopped him, Renee. Joseph's heart flutters when she asks him to draw a picture for her and he follows her to the painter's city, Delmo, to seize the last chance.\n\nHowever, after arriving at 'Delmo', he receives a completely different quest from his expectations...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/Davidmourn), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/portrait_of_david), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000054626), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9029169), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1434014565), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62140143)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_1000600), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/Davidmourn)",
